00:01:54,379 --> 00:01:58,383
a key tip for working with Claude Code
is providing clear context

45
00:01:58,383 --> 00:02:01,320
to help Claude code achieve the task you want efficiently.

46
00:02:01,320 --> 00:02:04,189
This means pointing Claude code to the relevant files,

47
00:02:04,189 --> 00:02:07,993
clearly describing the features
and functionality that you want

48
00:02:07,993 --> 00:02:10,362
and making sure that you're properly extending

49
00:02:10,362 --> 00:02:12,564
the capabilities of Claude code

50
00:02:12,564 --> 00:02:15,200
with MCP servers and other tools in that ecosystem.

51
