81
00:03:33,445 --> 00:03:35,814
In the next video, Elie will share

82
00:03:36,181 --> 00:03:38,383
Claude Code's underlying architecture,

83
00:03:38,817 --> 00:03:42,120
and you might be surprised by
how simple the architecture is.

84
00:03:42,654 --> 00:03:45,357
Claude Code relies on just
a small number of tools to search

85
00:03:45,357 --> 00:03:47,526
for patterns within your code files,

86
00:03:47,659 --> 00:03:50,762
to list directories, look at files,
do regex.

87
00:03:51,129 --> 00:03:53,565
It does not rely on semantically embedding

88
00:03:53,565 --> 00:03:56,768
your code in the code base
or transforming it into

89
00:03:56,768 --> 00:03:59,371
searchable structure. And one of the things that

90
00:03:59,371 --> 00:04:00,906
I think has made Claude Code effective

91
00:04:00,906 --> 00:04:04,209
is how it agentically can read through your code

92
00:04:04,209 --> 00:04:09,114
to take notes in a file called code.md
to figure out autonomously

93
00:04:09,114 --> 00:04:11,416
what is going on your codebase to then

94
00:04:11,416 --> 00:04:13,685
drive decision-making on how to advance your code.

95
00:04:14,152 --> 00:04:16,154
That's right. And because of that, and not

96
00:04:16,154 --> 00:04:17,823
having a need to index the codebase,

97
00:04:17,823 --> 00:04:20,726
you can ensure the codebase stays local.

98
